# Stow folds this whole directory into the repo, so EasyEffects writes its
# runtime files (impulse responses, rnnoise models, other presets) here too.
# Track only the speaker preset and its autoload rule.
*
!.gitignore
!output/
!output/XPS 15 Speakers.json
!autoload/
!autoload/output/
!autoload/output/*.json
